| onCrack | 1 | 1.05 | 1.08 | 0/2 | 1.08 |
| onCrack | 2 | 1.08 | 1.14 | 0/2 | 1.08 |
| onCrack | 3 | 1.07 | 1.05 | 0/2 | 1.07 |

